  <p>Returned by <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlDetectedTouchFace" target="_blank">llDetectedTouchFace</a> when the <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LSL_Touch_Position" target="_blank">touch position</a> is not valid.</p>
